│   ## Key features                                                            │
│                                                                              │
│   ### Pricing                                                                │
│                                                                              │
│   - **Rust pricing engine (VN)**: Core pricing logic is being migrated       │
│   from SkyHotel into Rust for deterministic, fast, and testable              │
│   calculation flows.                                                         │
│   - **Vietnam-specific business rules**: Supports VN-oriented pricing        │
│   workflows and lays the foundation for localized pricing behavior.          │
│   - **Tauri 2 backend integration**: Pricing computation can run natively    │
│   in the Rust layer and be exposed cleanly to the React 19 frontend.         │
│   - **Improved maintainability**: Centralizes pricing rules into a           │
│   strongly typed backend module instead of spreading logic across UI code.   │
│   - **Future-ready architecture**: Designed to support extension for         │
│   taxes, surcharges, discounts, room policies, and other pricing rules.      │
│                                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│   ### Pricing                                                                │
│   Pricing Engine VN is the effort to port SkyHotel’s pricing logic into      │
│   Rust.                                                                      │
│   This enables a more reliable and maintainable backend pricing pipeline     │
│   for the Tauri 2 + React 19 application, with better performance,           │
│   stronger typing, and clearer separation between UI and business rules.     │
